          "linkId": "fin-body",
          "text": "Copays and known self-pay amounts are due at check-in. We bill vision plans for routine exams and materials when eligible, and medical insurance for disease-related visits. Refraction, contact lens evaluation, retinal screening images, and premium testing may be patient-pay if not a covered benefit. Glasses and contact lens orders require a deposit. Custom products are non-refundable once ordered. Missed appointments or cancellations inside 24 hours may incur a fee. Returned checks and declined cards may incur a processing fee.",
